node_modules/
# .env holds only non-secret config (GEMINI_MODEL) — Firebase's dotenv
# convention for resolving defineString() params during CI deploys. The
# actual API key stays in Secret Manager via defineSecret(), never here.
# Any *local* override files stay ignored, since those are where a
# developer might accidentally put something sensitive.
.env.local
.env.*.local
firebase-debug.log
firebase-debug.*.log
